<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Energy raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer analyst Paul Hays confirmed he upgraded National Energy Group Inc to buy from outperform following the successful acquisition of Alexander Energy Corp. He noted as a result, National Energy had acquired &quot;a large number of approved development locations.&quot;</p>
<p>-- &quot;We think there will be good earnings progression and cashflow over the next three years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He reduced his share earnings estimate on National Energy for 1996 to $0.08 from $0.14 due to delays in the Alexander Energy acquisition but raised 1997's estimate to $0.32 from $0.14. He set a 1998 share estimate of $0.39.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 4-3/16 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
